{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Managed IT services in Birmingham"},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Birmingham and the wider West Midlands hold one of the densest concentrations of manufacturing, logistics and professional services in the UK. Businesses of that kind rarely have a single tidy office: there is usually a mix of desks, a warehouse or workshop, and people who are rarely at either."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Managed IT earns its keep in exactly that situation. Monitoring and patching run in the background across every device, the service desk answers the same working day, and a field engineer attends when the job needs someone on site."}]}